"EmbeddingGemma 2 is a best-in-class open model for natively multimodal embeddings (https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/embeddinggemma-2/)\nciteturn41354view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/embeddinggemma-2/\",\"lineno\":75}); Total lines: 299\nL0: cite0†iframe†www.googletagmanager.com L1: \nL2: Skip to main content\nL3: \nL4: EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model\nL5: \nL6:   * Innovation & AI\nL7:   * Products & platforms\nL8:   * Company news\nL9:   * cite1†Feed L10: \nL11: Back\nL12: ### Innovation & AI\nL13: \nL14: See all in Innovation & AI\nL15: \nL16:   * Models & Research\nL17:     * cite2†Google DeepMind L18:     * cite3†Google Research L19:     * cite4†Google Labs L20:     * cite5†Gemini models L21:     * cite6†Quantum computing L22:     * cite7†See all L23:   * Products\nL24:     * cite8†Developer tools L25:     * cite9†Gemini app L26:     * cite10†Gemini Notebook L27:     * cite11†See all L28:   * Infrastructure & cloud\nL29:     * cite12†Global network L30:     * cite13†Google Cloud L31:     * cite14†See all L32:   * Technology\nL33:     * cite15†Safety & Security L34:     * cite16†Health L35:     * cite17†See all L36: \nL37: * * *\nL38: Learn more:\nL39: \nL40:   * cite18†Google DeepMind blog†deepmind.google L41:   * cite19†Google Research blog†research.google L42:   * cite20†Google Developers blog†developers.googleblog.com L43:   * cite21†Google Cloud blog†cloud.google.com L44: \nL45: Back\nL46: ### Products & platforms\nL47: \nL48: See all in Products & platforms\nL49: \nL50:   * Products\nL51:     * cite22†Search L52:     * cite23†Maps L53:     * cite24†Chrome L54:     * cite25†Google Health L55:     * cite26†Google Workspace L56:     * cite27†Learning & Education L57:     * cite28†Shoppi